# CMake build trees
#
# `/build/*` rather than `/build/` so that the two helper scripts which live
# there can be re-included.  They are source, not output: gen_gf_text.py
# regenerates games/guofeng/gf_text.h (a committed header), and ppm2png.py
# converts the tests' PPM dumps to PNG.  Ignoring the whole directory would
# lose the generator and leave the header unexplained on a fresh clone.
/build/*
!/build/gen_gf_text.py
!/build/ppm2png.py
/out/
cmake-build-*/

# Visual Studio / MSVC artifacts that may appear next to the sources
*.user
*.suo
*.ncb
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.ilk
*.pdb
*.exp
*.idb
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate
*.log

# CMake itself
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
CMakeUserPresets.json

# Agent working data (memory + scratch builds) -- keep out of the repo
.workbuddy-ai/
*.ppm
